## Interface: 11509, 20506, 16001
## AllowLoadGameType: vanilla, tbc, camelot
## Title: ZacUI |cff33ff99Raid mods: Classic raids|r
## Notes: The boss mods for Molten Core, Blackwing Lair, Zul'Gurub, Ahn'Qiraj and Naxxramas. Loads by itself the first time you enter one of them (or open their settings).
## Author: Zac
## Version: 3.0.19
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZacUI\Media\addonIcon
## X-Category: Interface Enhancements
## Dependencies: Zacui, Zacui_RaidMods
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## X-ZacUI-Part: Raid mods: Classic raids

# Part of ZacUI. The five Classic Era raids of the raid mods, lifted out
# of Zacui_RaidMods (2026-11-13) so none of it is read at login or on a
# reload: 2.6 MB of the raid mods' 3.3, and not one of its pieces can load
# outside its raid. The game loads this folder the first time something
# of theirs could load where you stand, when the Raid mods page or /rm is
# opened, for a preview, or when every mover is about to be shown
# (Zacui_RaidMods\RM_Own.lua, O.LoadPacks). The files share ZacUI's
# namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by Core_Boot) and hand their pieces to
# the raid mods' engine exactly as they did from its folder; nothing is
# saved here. The raids' shapes and sounds stay in Zacui_RaidMods\Media.
#
# The order is the order the files had in the raid mods' own list: each
# raid's settings (<RAID>_Data), then its behaviour (<RAID>).
MoltenCore\MC_Data.lua
MoltenCore\MC.lua
BlackwingLair\BWL_Data.lua
BlackwingLair\BWL.lua
ZulGurub\ZG_Data.lua
ZulGurub\ZG.lua
AhnQiraj\AQ40_Data.lua
AhnQiraj\AQ40.lua
Naxxramas\NX_Data.lua
Naxxramas\NX.lua
